 section.\\nEHA Lymphoma Group\\nEuropean Research Initiative on CLL (ERIC)\\nEuropean Scientific foundation for Laboratory Hemato Oncology (ESLHO)\\nOverarching Specialized Working Group on Diagnostics in Hematology\\nSpecialized Working Group on Acute Myeloid Leukemia\\nSpecialized Working Group on Adolescents and Young Adults with Hematologic Diseases (AYA)\\nSpecialized Working Group on Adult Acute Lymphoblastic Leukemia\\nSpecialized Working Group on Aging and Hematology\\nSpecialized Working Group on Bleeding and Thrombosis\\nSpecialized Working Grou\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-b027569167b331c43c411500\", \"title\": \"About EHA - The European Hematology Association (EHA)About EHA - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\", \"source_ranges\": [{\"start\": 3854, \"end\": 4348, \"excerpt_start\": 0, \"excerpt_end\": 494}, {\"start\": 4589, \"end\": 4609, \"excerpt_start\": 495, \"excerpt_end\": 515}], \"navigation_excerpt\": true, \"text\": \"About EHA\\nMission and vision\\nBoard and committees\\nExecutive Office\\nEuropean affairs\\nCompliance, plans, and reports\\nPartnerships\\nWork at EHA\\nEHA Awards\\nGet involved\\nNews & updates\\n“Borderless Hematology is about giving the best quality of care to all hematology patients.”\\nProf Antonio Almeida, Past EHA President\\nHospital da Luz, Lisbon\\n“Borderless Hematology is about giving the best quality of care to all hematology patients.”\\nProf Antonio Almeida, Past EHA President\\nHospital da Luz, Lisbon\\nBecome an EHA Mentor\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-4a63fc37665d223b724eb647\", \"title\": \"Research & Innovation - The European Hematology Association (EHA)Research & Innovation - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\", \"source_ranges\": [{\"start\": 3902, \"end\": 4532, \"excerpt_start\": 0, \"excerpt_end\": 630}, {\"start\": 4773, \"end\": 4793, \"excerpt_start\": 631, \"excerpt_end\": 651}], \"navigation_excerpt\": true, \"text\": \"Research & Innovation\\nSpecialized Working Groups\\nHemaSphere\\nGrants\